# Inventory Manager  Key Features

1. Inventory Tracking: Allows users to add, update, and organize products in their inventory.
2. Purchase Price Tracking:Records how much each product costs to purchase.
3. Sales Management: Records completed sales and the selling prices of products.
4.Profit Calculation:Automatically calculates the profit earned from each sale.
5. Customer Management: Stores customer information and purchase history.
6. Business Performance Dashboard: Provides an overview of sales, profits, and inventory performance.
7.Inventory Status: Helps users identify which products are available and which have been sold.
